{"id":"wb-5-391","name":"富顺文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"富顺文庙","text":"富顺文庙位于四川省自贡市富顺县富世镇，始建于北宋，历经元明清各代重修。1980年7月7日列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。2001年6月25日公布为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n富顺文庙坐北朝南，东西宽46米，南北长160米，建筑面积2817平方米，沿中轴线由南至北分布有泮池、棂星门、大成门、大成殿、崇圣祠、敬一亭等建筑。大成殿始建于元至元二十八年（1291年），重檐歇山顶，面阔30.2米，进深21.3米，高25米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%8C%E9%A1%BA%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92488135,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92488135","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d289d6ead972e9e434455c7c.jpg","title":"Fushun_Wenmiao_2014.04.23_14-22-41.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fushun_Wenmiao_2014.04.23_14-22-41.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/Fushun_Wenmiao_2014.04.23_14-22-41.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"富顺文庙——\n\n泮池和棂星门","width":320,"height":213}}